cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Dioptra in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "Dioptra: data, statistics and publication graphs without the spreadsheet"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "ZahakJ"
    given-names: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZahakJ/dioptra"
url: "https://zahakj.github.io/dioptra/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
keywords:
  - statistics
  - data analysis
  - scientific graphics
  - GraphPad Prism
abstract: >-
  Dioptra is a cross-platform desktop application for scientific data: a spreadsheet-like
  grid with a formula language, a statistical engine tested against NIST StRD certified
  values and SciPy/statsmodels/lifelines oracles, and a publication-quality plotting engine
  that exports SVG, PDF and PNG.
